{"version":1,"content":"<p>女團IdG Bubbles、樂隊晚安莉莉及糖妹黃山怡，昨晚（10月31日）以嘩鬼造型出席旺角萬聖節派對。</p><p>IdG Bubbles成員小倬、Yoyo、夢月、家鑾、Anesa、Kathy和班長Cind甫出場，已帶起全場氣氛，她們笑說平時都好鍾意Cosplay，今次可以正式扮嘩鬼上台，超開心，她們更說萬聖節要在街上玩先夠氣氛！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.201902+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T06:45:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:21.598837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"00dc473776fbc4f0c56945ce9b60c59213f0a612cd5c0402f126c54111f58f76","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}